ice-overs</strong> (with German and Italian subtitles)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062380/extras/758b0b3a0f27cdc270a7f6907ca75430.webp?t=1746861291\" /></div> Sequel to the acclaimed &quot;The Hand of Glory&quot; (<strong>95% positive reviews</strong> on Steam), though no prior familiarity is necessary<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062380/extras/e53a76dc4cf0c5b0ae42cfc35b896108.poster.avif?t=1746861291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062380/extras/e53a76dc4cf0c5b0ae42cfc35b896108.webm?t=1746861291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062380/extras/e53a76dc4cf0c5b0ae42cfc35b896108.mp4?t=1746861291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
